{
  "title": "Sweet Home",
  "description": "After an unexpected family tragedy, a reclusive high school student is forced to leave his home -- only to face something much scarier: a reality where monsters are trying to wipe out humanity. Now he must fight alongside a handful of reluctant heroes to try and save the world before it’s too late.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: 21st century, Action, Dead Family Member, Deception, Drama, Gore, Hikikomori, Horror, Infectious Virus, Male Protagonist, Orphans, Philosophy, Psychological, Seinen, South Korea, Supernatural, Thriller, Traumatic Past, Urban, Adapted to KDrama, Adapted to Live Action, Apartment Life, Apocalypse, Apocalyptic Future, Coming of Age, Death of Loved One, Depression, Family Drama, Fantasy, Flashbacks, Full Color, Kill or Be Killed Situation, Korean Folklore, Loneliness, Longstrip, Male Lead, Manhwa, Mental Illness, Monsters, School, Split Personality, Suicidal Character, Survival, Suspense, Web Comic, Character Growth, Female Fighters, Lost Family, Orphan Male Lead, Past Plays a Big Role, Personality Change, Ruthless Character, Suicidal Male Lead, Trauma, Traumatized Male Lead, Web Comic With OST",
